# Chi dung cho "npm run build:prod" chay tren may, tuc ban build duoc phuc vu sau
# mot nginx co proxy /api va /ws (chinh la frontend/Dockerfile + nginx.conf.template).
# Vi vay o day la duong dan TUONG DOI: trang goi ve chinh origin cua no, nginx moi
# quyet dinh backend nam o dau.
#
# Truoc day file nay tro vao http://vivacon.cf, mot domain da chet.
#
# HAI DIEU CAN BIET:
#
# 1. Docker build KHONG doc file nay. frontend/Dockerfile tu dat ENV REACT_APP_*.
#
# 2. Tren VERCEL thi dat REACT_APP_API_URL / REACT_APP_SOCKET_URL trong
#    Project Settings > Environment Variables, voi URL TUYET DOI tro den backend,
#    vi du https://api.vi-du.com/api va https://api.vi-du.com/ws.
#    Bien moi truong that cua Vercel thang file nay, vi dotenv khong ghi de bien da
#    ton tai trong process.env. Nhung neu quen dat, build se lang le dung /api o day
#    va trang se goi https://<project>.vercel.app/api/v1/... roi nhan 404 - Vercel
#    khong co backend nao de tra loi.
REACT_APP_API_URL=/api
REACT_APP_SOCKET_URL=/ws
NODE_ENV=production
